Interview Template
Linked List
     ↓
Slow + Fast → Find middle
     ↓
Reverse second half
     ↓
Traverse first half + reversed half
     ↓
Calculate required result

One small improvement: because the list is guaranteed to have even length, your while (prev != null) comparison loop is sufficient. You don't need to compare beyond the second half.
